flowchart LR
    classDef git fill:#E1BEE7,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef ci fill:#FFE082,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef stg fill:#B3E5FC,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef prod fill:#C8E6C9,stroke:#333,color:#000
    classDef rb fill:#FFCDD2,stroke:#333,color:#000

    PR[Pull Request]:::git --> CI1["PR Checks<br/>lint test build"]:::ci
    CI1 --> MERGE[Merge main]:::git
    MERGE --> CI2["Main workflow<br/>test and image build"]:::ci
    CI2 --> AR["Push to<br/>Artifact Registry"]:::ci

    AR --> GREEN["Deploy Green<br/>Cloud Run no-traffic"]:::stg
    GREEN --> MIG["Forward-Compatible<br/>Migration Job"]:::stg
    MIG --> SMOKE["Smoke Test<br/>green URL"]:::stg

    SMOKE -->|fail| RB1[Rollback to Blue]:::rb
    SMOKE -->|pass| SHIFT["Traffic Shift<br/>10 → 50 → 100%"]:::stg

    SHIFT -->|metrics fail| RB2[Instant Rollback]:::rb
    SHIFT -->|metrics pass| READY[Ready for Fleet]:::stg

    READY --> W1["Canary<br/>wave"]:::prod
    W1 --> W2["Early-Adopter<br/>wave"]:::prod
    W2 --> W3["General<br/>wave"]:::prod
    W3 --> W4["Conservative<br/>wave"]:::prod

    W1 -.->|failure| HALT[Halt Wave]:::rb
    W2 -.->|failure| HALT
    W3 -.->|failure| HALT
